    <string name="setup_home_watcher_title">Detect the home screen</string>
    <string name="setup_home_watcher_body">Lets the dock and clock appear on the home screen only, instead of on top of every app. Glassify is told which app came to the front and nothing else — it cannot read screen content or anything you type.</string>

    <string name="home_watcher_description">Lets Glassify show its glass dock and clock on the home screen only. It reads which app is in the foreground and nothing else.</string>
